      "start": 66.44,
      "end": 72.82,
      "text": "rather than as successive campaigns of one and the same war. But the interval between them was",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 72.82,
      "end": 78.58,
      "text": "so short that the ink of the signatures to the Treaty of Gundamook may be said to have been",
